# Append-only logs that nearly every PR edits (daily refresh PRs add a
# learned-pattern line to REFRESH.md and an item to backlog.md). Two PRs
# adding different lines in the same spot is not a real conflict: keep both.
# Applies to local merges (git merge, the app's sync with base); GitHub's
# web merge ignores it, so merge main into the branch locally when it flags one.
REFRESH.md merge=union
backlog.md merge=union
issues.md merge=union
